1
00:00:01,010 --> 00:00:05,010
Please, please, I don't know.

2
00:00:05,010 --> 00:00:08,010
Think of your wife, Nina, and let me loose.

3
00:00:08,010 --> 00:00:10,010
No, they have nothing to do with this.

4
00:00:10,010 --> 00:00:13,010
They will, unless you tell me where Lennox is.

5
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,010
Where did you get that?

6
00:00:18,010 --> 00:00:20,010
Sit down.

7
00:00:20,010 --> 00:00:24,010
Your mission was to take out Valencia at Portram.

8
00:00:24,010 --> 00:00:26,010
What's going on here?

9
00:00:26,010 --> 00:00:28,010
Just to answer the questions.

10
00:00:28,010 --> 00:00:31,010
So you hit the dockyard based on Valencia's info?

11
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:33,010
Yes. Under what authority?

12
00:00:33,010 --> 00:00:36,010
Lieutenant Macarver. She briefed the vision and they greenlit the op.

13
00:00:36,010 --> 00:00:38,010
No, they did not.

14
00:00:38,010 --> 00:00:40,010
She never went up the chain.

15
00:00:40,010 --> 00:00:43,010
What? Macarver has been under investigation for some time now.

16
00:00:43,010 --> 00:00:45,010
Your mission ended at the Steelworks.

17
00:00:45,010 --> 00:00:48,010
You had no authority to execute that operation.

18
00:00:48,010 --> 00:00:51,010
We had division dockets that outlined the operation.

19
00:00:51,010 --> 00:00:54,010
My former team would go in first and pull the trigger.

20
00:00:54,010 --> 00:00:56,010
I was writing shotguns with Macarver and Solomon.

21
00:00:56,010 --> 00:01:00,570
Solomon, two teams, one area, Lennox, was the target.
